# lang-zig — Zig developer toolchain (FETCHED-ONLINE, never baked). The Zig
# compiler + the Zig Language Server, both official-repo. No mise: directive —
# the official `zig` package tracks the current release and mise's Zig support is
# less established than for the GC'd runtimes, so the system package is the
# straightforward path here. `iictl pack remove lang-zig` -Rns's the set.
#meta:type lang
zig
zls
